{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "91f98ed9e5a793661220d1b802b21334ce87cb56a11a34d929a60f3012443564", "ja": "響、ブログ読ませてもらったぞ。\nPVの宣伝もしてくれてありがとうな！", "zh": "响，我看了你的部落格啰。\n谢谢你顺便帮忙宣传PV！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "96dd6e521ffd4062f28f64e61ed29d21f8b07fc1f52c877ed9e2a54f4ffc17cd", "ja": "そんなの当たり前だぞっ。自分も公演には、\nたくさんの人に来てもらいたいからねっ！", "zh": "没什么好道谢的喔！\n本人也希望能有更多人来看公演啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "c3604070ee18208e6640ca6154c3cb1c9fc0736274e73a3420757907b5a91b66", "ja": "それより{$P$}……この衣装、\n自分にちゃんと似合ってる？　おかしくない？", "zh": "先不说这个，{$P$}……\n这套服装适合本人吗？会不会很奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d827ca45924114d1d6626e5964564d226466d5df875bad1af87b9f4a1cdbb19d", "ja": "うん？　とても似合ってると思うけど……。\n気に入らないところでもあったか？", "zh": "嗯？我觉得很适合你啊……\n你有哪里不喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "dc99c686b24f1d0f9fbbb48188855831a04559f1b5b75545aedeb5c57b89a134", "ja": "ううん、自分はめちゃくちゃ大好きだぞっ！\nフワフワしてて、最高にかわいいよねっ♪", "zh": "没有，本人超喜欢喔！\n轻飘飘的，超可爱对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "5f173f959c1ec6b2730d6231848f3ae823912cae940bc6fe6bfa92a4e11306c6", "ja": "でも、今までの自分の衣装とは、\nちょっと違うでしょ？", "zh": "不过，这跟至今为止本人的服装相比，\n不是有点不一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1006_p", "source_sha256": "fed1cc02843fc8cc0698034761044294a92525922dfc7e007105749455f56692", "ja": "ん？　ああ、確かにクール系が多い響の衣装にしては、\n目新しいかな？", "zh": "嗯？对诶，以服装风格偏帅气的响来说，\n确实还挺耳目一新的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "580309473c8bcc17ac132f4daefde9ada7edfac1ee6f4dd8645b03380fb00af6", "ja": "だから、ちょっと心配になって……\nあ、ちょっとだけね。本当にちょっとだけ！", "zh": "所以本人才有一点担心……\n啊，一点点而已喔，真的只有一点点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1008_p", "source_sha256": "133419aa06fa7a468abc2b1054599771f309ea9347cd24bfa5d9c5501d9cc7ca", "ja": "わかってるって。でも大丈夫、すごく似合ってるよ。\nむしろ響だからこそ、着こなせると思ってたんだ。", "zh": "我懂的。不过别担心，非常适合你喔。\n不如说我觉得正因为是响，才能穿得这么好看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "4604710b9e29cbf8cdabb3f451fe2b865cd1589e29bde65aa90f164a75b89184", "ja": "えっ。そ、そうなんだ……。\nふ、ふーん。", "zh": "咦？是、是吗……\n哦，这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "bcb0391471baaffdf94d91451e4807557dc6f7c7017eb277362a56031abc79bb", "ja": "うんっ、{$P$}は間違ってないぞ！\n自分は衣装の着こなしもカンペキだからね♪", "zh": "嗯，{$P$}没有说错喔！\n因为本人就连表演服装也能完美驾驭啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a7ad0993312112d974a39fb99dc15d4769e71b6c46499365644354f1bfc9ec2e", "ja": "はは、そうか。\nならその衣装で、次のライブも楽々こなせるな？", "zh": "哈哈，是这样啊。那么下次你也能穿着那身服装，\n轻松驾驭演唱会啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "a16d089d57727eb8787062cc62d1999d1c5dbbcbcc83430e723007a392616294", "ja": "なんくるないさー！　すっごいライブにするから、\n見ててよ{$P$}！", "zh": "总会有办法的啦──！本人会带来最棒的演唱会，\n你要看好啰，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "cbc26210b581d16a3fe6b966384e31538d842ae62e70f5cf52a280c2bec66840", "ja": "よしっ！　そしたら、遊んでる場合じゃないぞ。\n気合い入れてレッスンしないと！", "zh": "好！那么现在就不是玩的时候了。\n得提起干劲去做训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "f80b61a4ba5e124f619d8f967bcf4894cb1b477c233b24ac626ac3705bbecfac", "ja": "{$P$}、レッスンするから\n付き合ってね！　あ、その前に着替えないと……。", "zh": "{$P$}，本人要去做训练，\n你也要一起来喔！啊，在那之前要先换衣服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ffc33a8f661a5e7f7b5392c296d14849cad92ebea8c326c74baa1f71978e5cc2", "ja": "ああ、もちろん……って、響！\n着替えるなら、俺が出てからにしてくれ。", "zh": "嗯，当然好……等等，响！\n你要换衣服的话，等我出去了再换。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "224cd74c054a82ea9bd68f66493c4055a4f41f171bea26502725a6a41b7bb1b8", "ja": "あっ！？　そっか、{$P$}が\nいたんだった。ごめんごめん……えへへ。", "zh": "啊！？对耶，都忘了{$P$}还在。\n抱歉抱歉……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0054_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "7afaa2b2888ffd801f0ff0c1e2a2fa58b2ec296ce77dc5ee6077f9531a89b2df", "ja": "それじゃ、着替えたらレッスンルームに行くから！\n{$P$}、待っててね！", "zh": "那等本人换好衣服就会过去练习室！\n{$P$}，你先去等我喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
